<view class="container gk-screen">
  <view class="gk-head">
    <button class="ui-back" bindtap="goBack" aria-label="返回名人观察"><view class="ui-icon ui-icon--back"></view></button>
    <view class="gk-head-title">把猜想放回线索里</view>
    <text class="gk-head-tag">名人观察</text>
  </view>

  <text class="gk-tag gk-tag--aqua">{{voteLabel}}</text>
  <view class="insight-title">愿景、计划与行动，</view>
  <view class="insight-title">你看到了哪一面？</view>
  <view class="gk-small insight-lead">我们从一篇马斯克署名的公开文章出发，讨论他的工作表达方式。</view>

  <view class="gk-card insight-card">
    <view class="gk-between">
      <view class="gk-title-sm">一条可以核对的线索</view>
      <text class="gk-tag gk-tag--gray">{{insight.tag}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="gk-small insight-fact">{{insight.fact}}</view>
    <button class="insight-source" bindtap="muskSource">
      <view class="ui-icon ui-icon--cards insight-source-icon"></view>
      <text>{{insight.factSource}}</text>
      <view class="gk-chevron"></view>
    </button>
  </view>

  <view class="gk-card">
    <view class="gk-title-sm">这条线索，可以怎么理解？</view>
    <view class="insight-observation">
      <text class="gk-tag">一种解读</text>
      <view class="insight-observation-text">{{insight.read1.text}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="insight-observation">
      <text class="gk-tag gk-tag--pink">仍有其他解释</text>
      <view class="insight-observation-text">{{insight.read2.text}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="gk-tiny insight-observation-note">公开表达呈现了一个工作场景，也给不同解释留出空间。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="insight-bridge">
    <view class="gk-feature-icon gk-feature-icon--aqua"><view class="ui-icon ui-icon--leaf"></view></view>
    <view class="insight-bridge-title">把这个问题，带回自己。</view>
    <view class="insight-bridge-copy">你做决定时，更在意什么？<text class="insight-br"></text>从自己的真实选择里找线索。</view>
    <button class="gk-primary" bindtap="startOwnPreferences">免费看看我的性格偏好</button>
    <button class="gk-quiet" bindtap="startClassicTraits">也可以先体验经典性格题</button>
  </view>

  <button class="gk-secondary" bindtap="topicShare">生成一张"你会怎么选"海报</button>
  <view class="gk-footer-note">朋友点开后先看到这个话题，也能直接开始自测。<text class="insight-br"></text>基础结果直接免费查看，分享由你决定。</view>
</view>
